29
00:01:31.777 --> 00:01:33.712
ma fino al livello della sutura

30
00:01:34.655 --> 00:01:35.375
coronale.

31
00:01:37.037 --> 00:01:37.842
Esistono a volte

32
00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:42.712
